 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "c-V-FG8bSmoJ",
   "from": "Tareef Kawaf",
   "author": "edbcc711cdbb3da8",
   "date": "2014-08-12T13:27:37Z",
   "subject": "[8/12/14] New Shinyapps package and enhancements to shinyapps.io",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Dear shinyapps users,</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Over the past few weeks we have been working hard on quite a few changes, and we thought it was time to announce them to you all and gather some feedback.  For those just starting out, or if you signed up for Shinyapps but haven’t gotten started because you were intimidated by our instructions, check out </span><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/shinyapps.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/shinyapps.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LYTHfGdz5mjYgylvZCaMu\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">this article</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">.  </span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">For existing users, our investments have been primarily focused on making the platform more robust, faster, and easier for you to see and correct errors that may be occurring in your application.  </span></p><br><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Reliability -- changes introduced over the past 3 weeks have improved the reliability of the service and resulted in a five fold decrease in the errors reported.  </span></p></li></ul><br><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Performance -- speed improvements for application start times have been measured at 3 to 5 times faster since the changes rolled out.  </span></p></li></ul><br><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Visibility/debugging - a new version of the shinyapps package has been released which you can use to explore the logs of your running application (check out shinyapps::showLogs()  in </span><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/shinyapps.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/shinyapps.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LYTHfGdz5mjYgylvZCaMu\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">this article</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">).  Please note that you will need to install the latest version of the shinyapps package from github and to redeploy your application. </span></p></li></ul><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Thank you all for your help in improving the <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NBbof7zdrzzcSwD4Hysk-\">shinyapps.io</a> platform.  Over the coming weeks we will be making additional improvements to the build and deploy times for applications, and adding support for additional R packages.  We look forward to your feedback as always.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Best,</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">The Shinyapps team   </span></p><br><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">PS.  As of this morning we have added support for the </span><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/nloptr/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/nloptr/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ttQcmEyCJ9cuD4foV42ch\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">nloptr</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"> package.  </span></p><div><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"><br></span></div></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
