=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Reliability -- changes introduced over the past 3 weeks have improved the reliability of the service and resulted in a five fold decrease in the errors reported.  </span></p></li></ul><br><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Performance -- speed improvements for application start times have been measured at 3 to 5 times faster since the changes rolled out.  </span></p></li></ul><br><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;background-color:transparent\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Visibility/debugging - a new version of the shinyapps package has been released which you can use to explore the logs of your running application (check out shinyapps::showLogs()  in </span><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/shinyapps.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/shinyapps.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163228000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0iUBTkWnroJiJgT0JAM2Ie\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">this article</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">).  Please note that you will need to install the latest version of the shinyapps package from github and to redeploy your application. </span></p></li></ul><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Thank you all for your help in improving the <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163228000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2L63YboIa1eb33BFwTDHSz\">shinyapps.io</a> platform.  Over the coming weeks we will be making additional improvements to the build and deploy times for applications, and adding support for additional R packages.  We look forward to your feedback as always.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Best,</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">The Shinyapps team   </span></p><br><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">PS.  As of this morning we have added support for the </span><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/nloptr/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/nloptr/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363163228000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BXY7liqtjyNkPV4aUlnPu\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;white-