     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">We will probably submit it as we get ourselves out of the beta.  We needed to give ourselves the ability to rev the package more quickly.   <div><br></div><div>You can see which version of packages you are running by calling:  sessionInfo()</div><div><br></div><div>HTH</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
